 🔐 Secure Shed — Secure Reminder & Meeting Manager

Secure Shed is a Flutter-based mobile application designed to combine **task and meeting management with user authentication, identity verification, and additional security features**.

The application allows users to securely register and manage their accounts, complete an identity-verification process, configure security options, create and manage tasks, view scheduled tasks through a calendar, and receive local task reminders.

✨ Features

🔑 Authentication

* User registration
* User login
* Logout
* Forgot password
* Password reset using Firebase Authentication

🪪 Identity Verification

* Personal information collection
* Address details
* Contact information
* Employment information
* Selfie capture
* CNIC front and back image capture
* Five-step identity-verification flow

🛡️ Security

* 6-digit PIN setup
* Face setup
* Fingerprint setup/simulation
* Local security preferences
* PIN hashing using SHA-256

> Note: Face and fingerprint functionality in the current version is implemented as a setup/simulation rather than real biometric authentication.

 📝 Task Management

* Create tasks
* View tasks
* Edit tasks
* Reschedule tasks
* Delete tasks
* Update task status
* Task categories
* Task priority
* Task location and notes
* Today's tasks
* Task retrieval by date/category

⚠️ Task Conflict Detection

Secure Shed checks scheduled tasks for overlapping times.

When a new task is created, its start and end times are compared with existing tasks on the same date. If an overlap is detected, the user is informed about the time conflict before saving the task.

📅 Calendar

* Calendar-based task viewing
* Tasks displayed according to date
* Priority-based visual indicators
* Selected-day task list
* Task status indicators

 🔔 Local Notifications

* Schedule task reminders
* Scheduled notifications using Flutter Local Notifications
* Time-zone-aware scheduling
* High-priority Android notifications

👤 Profile

* User information
* Task statistics
* Profile management

⚙️ Settings

* Application settings
* Security preferences
* Profile-related options



🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology                      | Purpose                                       |
| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| **Flutter**                     | Cross-platform mobile application development |
| **Dart**                        | Application programming                       |
| **Firebase Authentication**     | User registration, login and password reset   |
| **Cloud Firestore**             | Cloud database                                |
| **Shared Preferences**          | Local storage                                 |
| **Flutter Local Notifications** | Local task reminders                          |
| **Table Calendar**              | Calendar interface                            |
| **Image Picker**                | Camera/image capture                          |
| **Path Provider**               | Local file storage                            |
| **Crypto**                      | SHA-256 PIN hashing                           |
| **UUID**                        | Unique task IDs                               |
| **Visual Studio Code**          | Development environment                       |



 🏗️ Architecture

The application follows a layered structure:


Presentation Layer
        ↓
Business Logic / Services
        ↓
Firebase + Local Storage


Presentation Layer

The application contains screens for:

* Loading
* Get Started
* Introduction
* Login
* Signup
* Forgot Password
* Password Reset
* Identity Verification
* Security Setup
* Home
* Task Creation
* Task Display
* Rescheduling
* Calendar
* Today's Tasks
* Profile
* Settings

 Business Logic Layer

Main services include:

* `AuthService`
* `TaskService`
* `IdentityService`
* `NotificationService`
* `ImageService`
* `LocalSecurityStorage`

Data Layer

The application uses:

* Firebase Authentication
* Cloud Firestore
* Shared Preferences
* Local file storage

 🗄️ Firestore Collections

Users

Stores user account and security-related information.

Example fields:


uid
username
email
pinHash
pinEnabled
biometricEnabled
Tasks

Stores user-created tasks.

Example fields:


taskId
userId
title
description
category
location
date
startTime
endTime
notes
priority
status
createdAt
updatedAt

Identity Verification

Stores identity-verification information.

Example fields:

userId
fullName
cnic
phone
address
jobTitle
selfieImagePath
cnicFrontPath
cnicBackPath
createdAt


